<h1>Peta VatthuPv 4.14 Bhogasaṃharaṇa Sutta Accumulation of Wealth</h1>
<div class="entry-content">
		
			
<p class="narration wp-block-paragraph">Women traders who made money cheating people were reborn as ghosts. This is how they cried.</p>



<p class="character wp-block-paragraph">Ghosts:</p>



<p class="normal wp-block-paragraph">We earned money in good ways and in bad ways. Now our wealth is enjoyed by others. What we have here is only misery.</p>

		</div><!-- .entry-content -->
